<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-fifteen-foundations"><h4 id="topic-fifteen-foundations"><?php echo s($coughtext('Cough- and wheeze-relieving herbs: general introduction','Hierbas que alivian tos y sibilancia: introducción general')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($coughtext('Do not begin with the cough alone. Decide whether Lung Qi must rise or descend, whether Phlegm is Hot or Cold, and whether throat, Stomach, bowel or edema supplies the decisive clue.','No empieces solo por la tos. Decide si Qi de Pulmón debe subir o bajar, si la Flema es caliente o fría y si garganta, Estómago, intestino o edema aporta la pista decisiva.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__decision"><div><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Open upward','Abrir arriba')); ?></strong><span>Jie Geng</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Descend + bowel','Descender + intestino')); ?></strong><span>Xing Ren / Zi Su Zi</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Lung Heat + edema','Calor Pulmón + edema')); ?></strong><span>Sang Bai Pi</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Lung + Stomach Heat','Calor Pulmón + Estómago')); ?></strong><span>Pi Pa Ye</span></div></div><aside class="single-herbs-guide__memory-path"><p class="single-herbs-guide__memory-line"><?php echo s($coughtext('Enter the Lung elevator house.','Entra a la casa del elevador del Pulmón.')); ?></p><p><?php echo s($coughtext('Jie Geng opens the chimney upward; Xing Ren rolls down and oils the exit; Sang Bai Pi cools the red Lung and drains the basement; Pi Pa Ye links Lung to Stomach; Kuan Dong Hua muffles the cough; Zi Wan empties the Phlegm bucket; Bai Bu cares for the chronic cough; Zi Su Zi presses the wheezing elevator down.','Jie Geng abre la chimenea arriba; Xing Ren rueda abajo y lubrica la salida; Sang Bai Pi enfría Pulmón rojo y drena sótano; Pi Pa Ye conecta Pulmón-Estómago; Kuan Dong Hua silencia tos; Zi Wan vacía el cubo de Flema; Bai Bu cuida tos crónica; Zi Su Zi presiona abajo el elevador de sibilancia.')); ?></p><p><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Direction → temperature → companion clue → chronicity.','Dirección → temperatura → pista acompañante → cronicidad.')); ?></strong></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($coughtext('Normalized current list:','Listado vigente normalizado:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($coughtext('all eight unique herbs appear in Appendix A. Duplicate Zi Wan was removed; Su Zi is shown once under the official name Zi Su Zi.','las ocho hierbas únicas aparecen en Appendix A. Se eliminó Zi Wan duplicada; Su Zi aparece una sola vez bajo el nombre oficial Zi Su Zi.')); ?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach($coughherbs as $herb): ?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($herb['name']); ?></strong><em><?php echo s($herb['latin']); ?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge"><?php echo s($coughtext('Module + current Appendix A','Módulo + Appendix A vigente')); ?></span></div><p><?php echo s($herb['identity']); ?></p></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol></section>
